SUMMARY:FYI: BALLROOM DANCE NIGHT
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nJoin us for our 43rd Anniversary Dance\n**T
 here is no admission fee for this event**\nHedrick Rhodes Veterans Center\
 , (the old VFW)\n900 Main St. Hendersonville\, NC. 28792\nAdmission: $0.00
  p.p.\nDoors open at 2:45 and lesson will start on time\, 3:00-3:45\nHustl
 e lesson\n3:45-6:00 pm-Open Ballroom Dance\nAmple parking at the front ent
 ry of the building\, take the elevator or stairs to the upper level. Parki
 ng is limited at the rear entrance\, both front and back doors will be unl
 ocked.\n**Sunday\, Aug 9\, Attire:** Dress to impress\nEnjoy dancing to th
 e music of DJ Gary Bills\, who plays a variety of dance tunes. including S
 wing (East & West Coast)\, Waltz\, Tango\, Rumba\, Cha-Cha and Foxtrot. Th
 ere is also a mixer.\nWe are a friendly and relaxed dance club composed of
  dancers of all levels.\nOur dances are open to the public & everyone is i
 nvited.
