SUMMARY:A Domino Train Wreck Game afternoon
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nYou are convivially invited to an afternoon
  of raucous laughter and abandon while playing (a simplified) **Mexican Tr
 ain Wreck Dominoes**. This version of "Mexican Train" was developed by che
 ating during the long cold Winter of Wisconsin.\nThis event is for beginne
 rs and/or for those who do NOT take gaming seriously. This is a ‘social
 ’ event.\nThere will be no ‘Book of Hoyle’. There will be no ‘scor
 ekeeping’. Bring yo' funnybone!!\n**ENTRY FEE**: Free\n***Social hour at
  1:30 PM\; Games start at 2 PM***\nI will have up to 3 game tables reserve
 d.\n**NOTE:** if you park in ‘metered parking’\, carry your parking ta
 g – Dry Falls will give you a $credit.\nEnjoy a large\, climate-controll
 ed indoor area.\nAsst’d beers\, wines\, water & soft drinks available.\n
 A Mexican Food Truck is available\n**You are encouraged to purchase drink 
 at the venue.**\nhttps://dryfallsbrewing.com/\n**Optional:** You may bring
  (non-messy) finger food. (to share if you like).\ngordie's contact: Curmu
 dgeonHiker@gmail.com\n828.393.0297 (text only)
